{"id":"7784e483500704a1","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-lem-upward-lt.md","title":"Upward Löwenheim–Skolem","display":"lem-upward-lt — Upward Löwenheim–Skolem","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-lem-upward-lt","aliases":["58-lem-upward-lt"],"display":"lem-upward-lt — Upward Löwenheim–Skolem","depends_on":["[[../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-lem-upward-lt"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-lem-upward-lt</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-upward-lt — Upward Löwenheim–Skolem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"faf104362ffe13b3\" href=\"?note=faf104362ffe13b3\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md\">../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> (first-order language)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-structure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span> (universe of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,L)\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,L)\\)</span> (elementary-substructure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"faf104362ffe13b3\" href=\"?note=faf104362ffe13b3\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md\">../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}upward\\text{-}lt}\\vdash\n\\forall L\\,\\forall\\mathfrak A\\,\\forall\\kappa\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A,L)\\land\n\\aleph_0\\leq|\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)|\\land\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\n\\max\\bigl(|\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)|,|L|\\bigr)\\leq\\kappa\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\n\\exists\\mathfrak B\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak B,L)\\land\n\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,L)\\land\n|\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak B)|=\\kappa\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}upward\\text{-}lt}\\vdash\n\\forall L\\,\\forall\\mathfrak A\\,\\forall\\kappa\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A,L)\\land\n\\aleph_0\\leq|\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)|\\land\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\n\\max\\bigl(|\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)|,|L|\\bigr)\\leq\\kappa\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\n\\exists\\mathfrak B\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak B,L)\\land\n\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,L)\\land\n|\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak B)|=\\kappa\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The infinitude assumption is necessary: a finite structure may have no larger elementary extension.</li>\n<li>The usual proof applies compactness after adjoining constants for the elements of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\)</span> and for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> many distinct elements.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md","status":"resolved","id":"faf104362ffe13b3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A$ ($L$-structure, see [[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md","status":"resolved","id":"faf104362ffe13b3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,L)$ (elementary-substructure predicate, see [[../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)$ (cardinal predicate, see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}upward\\text{-}lt}\\vdash\n\\forall L\\,\\forall\\mathfrak A\\,\\forall\\kappa\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A,L)\\land\n\\aleph_0\\leq|\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)|\\land\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\n\\max\\bigl(|\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)|,|L|\\bigr)\\leq\\kappa\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\n\\exists\\mathfrak B\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak B,L)\\land\n\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,L)\\land\n|\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak B)|=\\kappa\n\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":1559,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3927","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-lem-upward-lt.md|58-lem-upward-lt]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["faf104362ffe13b3","5fb1c2241d1943d1","d9b8711cda3f31ca"]}